== Overview ==
'''Dual Buzzsaw Toilet Car''' is a fast [[Enemies|enemy]] with decent health. It appears rarely in [[Hard Mode|hard mode]], and in [[Nightmare Mode|nightmare mode]]. It can stun [[units]] with its buzzsaws. 

== Health ==
Wave 42: 214,500 HP

Wave 50: 250,500 HP

== Appearance ==
The '''Dual Buzzsaw Toilet car''' has  two identical buzzsaw on each sides, has 4 large, black wheels attached to it, and a metal plate protecting the front of the toilet.
== Abilities ==

* Buzzsaw Slice: Uses its buzzsaws to stun a unit.

== Strategy ==
== Trivia ==
This toilet is based off of the Dual Buzzsaw Car Skibidi Toilet.

In the [[Episode 61 Update]] Leaks, Telanthric said that this was going to be in both [[Hard Mode]] and [[Nightmare Mode]], but it was only in [[Nightmare Mode]].

